      <title>十月EV销量“急刹车”，降价潮是抄底信号还是凛冬将至？</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251114-%E5%8D%81%E6%9C%88ev%E9%94%80%E9%87%8F%E6%80%A5%E5%88%B9%E8%BD%A6%E9%99%8D%E4%BB%B7%E6%BD%AE%E6%98%AF%E6%8A%84%E5%BA%95%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E5%87%9B%E5%86%AC%E5%B0%86%E8%87%B3/</link>
